urrentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"389\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"1141\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-62\" x=\"2141\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-69\" x=\"2571\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"2849\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"3461\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"4462\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-63\" x=\"4851\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"5507\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-64\" x=\"6508\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-69\" x=\"7031\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"7310\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"7977\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"9033\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"9423\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"10175\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-63\" x=\"11175\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"11609\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"12221\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"13221\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-62\" x=\"13611\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"14263\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-64\" x=\"15263\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"15787\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-69\" x=\"16176\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"16455\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Subtracting complex numbers works in the same way: we just subtract the real parts and subtract the imaginary parts separately. For example,</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg x